  aciklama:
  - "Fal\u0131n\u0131n ba\u015Flar\u0131nda, insanlara kar\u015F\u0131 y\xFCz\xFCnde
    ara ara beliren g\xFCl\xFCmsemeye ra\u011Fmen seni mutsuz ve pi\u015Fman bir
    halde g\xF6r\xFCyorum. \U0001F921Gelece\u011Fe dair belirsizliklerin, \"y\xFCzeyini
    buland\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131 eski bir aynaya\" bak\u0131yor gibisin. O aynada
    g\xF6zlerini g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn gen\xE7, ruhundaki ihtiyar\u0131 adeta su\xE7
    \xFCst\xFC yakalam\u0131\u015F gibi {{isim}}... Geride b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    ili\u015Fkilerin sana vakit kaybettirdi\u011Fini, y\u0131llar\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131p
    g\xF6t\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC ve seni y\u0131pratt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    fark etmi\u015F olmal\u0131s\u0131n. Art\u0131k \"sabitini\" arad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hissediyorum. Onu bulmak, ona varmak ve son g\xFCc\xFCnle ona s\u0131ms\u0131k\u0131
    tutunmak istiyorsun."
